<h3><u>Mai Royi jahan</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span data-ft=""{""tn"":""K""}"" class=""userContent"">Haye ...<br> <br> Sun Lo Sakina (S.a) Ka Nauha Chacha, Kya Mujh Pe Guzri Jafa<br> <br> Jub Tum Rahe Na Rahe Baba Jaan.<br> <br> Sham E Ghariba Ki Jagi Hui, Main Soi Kahan.., Khaie Tamache Mai Roi Jahan.2<br> <span class=""text_exposed_show""><br> Jis Din Se Baba Gaye Chod Kar,<br> <br> Jis Din Se Daag E Yatimi Mila<br> <br> Kya Kya Masaib Mile Hai Mujhe,<br> <br> Kaise Batau Tumhe Aai Chacha..2<br> <br> Daman Jala Chingi Hai Rida, Chin Gai Balian..<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Kaise Bayan Main Karu Apne Gam,<br> <br> Bus Dil Pe Sub Zakhm Ghehre Lage,<br> <br> Yeh Jism Hi Sirf Qaidi Nahi,<br> <br> Meri Fuga Par Bhi Pehre Lage..2<br> <br> Chup Chup Ke Roie, Ghut Ghut Ke Karti Rahi Hun Fuga<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Maqtal Ki Jalti Hui Reet Par,<br> <br> Roti Thi Zer E Alam Baith Kar<br> <br> Bus Aap Ke Gam Me Mere Chacha,<br> <br> Rehti Thi Din Raat Main Nauha Gar..2<br> <br> Baad Aap Ke Is Yatima (S.a.) Ne Jheli Hai Kya Sakhtiyan,<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Shame Gariba haweda huie<br> <br> Charon Taraf Teergi Cha Gai<br> <br> Koi Muhafiz Na Jub Reh Gaya,<br> <br> Fauj E Sitam Loot Ne Aagai..2<br> <br> Kya Kaya Masaib Uthaie Hai Maine, Karu Kya Bayan<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Gyarah Moharram Ki Aaie Sahar,<br> <br> Qaidi Bani Mai Rasan Pahan Kar<br> <br> Bazu Bandhe Subke, Mera Gala,<br> <br> Panjo Pe Chal Ke Kiya Who Safar,..2<br> <br> Karbal Se Kufa, Ya Kufa Se Musal Ki Woh Wadiyan<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Rahanon Me Yeh Saneha Bhi Hua,<br> <br> Mai Chut Gai Kafele Se Chacha,<br> <br> Tab Dadi Zehra (S.a.) Wahan Aa Gai,<br> <br> Kutch Der Mujhko Sukon Mil Gaya,..2<br> <br> Dil Tham Kar Woh Bhi Rone Lagi, Jub Suni Yeh Fuga<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Manga Kanizi Me Jis Dum Mujhe,<br> <br> Dam Mera Had Se Siwa Ho Gya,<br> <br> Dil Mera Yeh Kehke Rone Laga,<br> <br> Aai Kash Is Wakt Hote Chacha,..2<br> <br> Yeh Zulm Us Par Jo Aashur Se, Kar Rahi Hai Fuga<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.<br> <br> Farhan O Mazhar Fuga Kam Na Ho ,<br> <br> Patthar Hai Woh Aankh Jo Nam Na Ho,<br> <br> Farshe Aza Pe Yeh Mumkin Nahi,<br> <br> ZikrE Sakina (S.a) Ho, Matam Naho..2<br> <br> Socho Agar, To Mukammal Hai Nauha , Yeh Jumla Yahan<br> <br> Khaie Tamache.</span></span></p>
               
